WEBVTT

00:00:00.009 --> 00:01:45.830
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:05.920
What are you doing here?

00:02:08.039 --> 00:02:08.680
And you?

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:09.919
Why are you here too?

00:02:11.759 --> 00:02:13.319
I'm heading to the shop at the far end.

00:02:13.759 --> 00:02:14.199
What about you?

00:02:14.719 --> 00:02:16.439
I've got some business at the far end too.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:29.759
Which place are you going to?

00:02:29.879 --> 00:02:31.400
Just this one. You?

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:33.520
I forgot my cigarettes.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:34.400
I'll go grab them.

00:02:34.639 --> 00:02:35.879
I've got some here.

00:02:36.199 --> 00:02:37.680
Had I known you liked playing this too,

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:38.759
why bother going singing?

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.039
We have to sing and play cards too, right?

00:02:41.039 --> 00:02:42.400
Otherwise, where would we spend our winnings?

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:43.680
Boss, cigarettes.

00:02:43.919 --> 00:02:44.719
Take this for now.

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:53.319
Who's this?

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.360
My buddy.

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:57.319
Let's go.

00:03:06.919 --> 00:03:08.319
Today, I want to give special praise

00:03:08.319 --> 00:03:09.159
to our cadre.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:10.479
A meeting was scheduled,

00:03:10.719 --> 00:03:12.439
the Hong Kong, China guest was here by 8,

00:03:12.719 --> 00:03:14.159
and what was our man doing?

00:03:14.159 --> 00:03:16.479
At 8:15, he was still on the road.

00:03:16.759 --> 00:03:17.240
What?

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:18.599
Too exhausted from work?

00:03:19.159 --> 00:03:19.919
Overslept?

00:03:21.879 --> 00:03:23.479
There couldn't be any other reason, right?

00:03:24.039 --> 00:03:26.639
I get up at 5:00 every morning.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:28.039
Are you busier than me?

00:03:28.919 --> 00:03:30.599
A 100-yuan fine for every minute late.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:31.960
After the meeting,

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:34.120
deliver the cash to the government office.

00:03:34.319 --> 00:03:35.000
Director Wu...

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:35.599
I... I... I...

00:03:35.599 --> 00:03:37.199
I've apologized to the Hong Kong, China businessman.

00:03:37.479 --> 00:03:38.560
He isn't upset anymore,

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:39.879
and we've scheduled to meet tomorrow.

00:03:39.879 --> 00:03:40.680
Don't worry, Director Wu.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:41.719
I am worried.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.599
Not tomorrow, make it today.

00:03:51.199 --> 00:03:52.599
I've been waiting for your call.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:53.560
Really?

00:03:57.599 --> 00:03:58.400
That's wonderful!

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.599
That's great, that's great!

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:04.639
Okay, okay, okay.

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:06.800
All right, all right, all right.

00:04:08.439 --> 00:04:10.159
Great, then I'll wait for your update.

00:04:15.159 --> 00:04:15.960
What are you doing?

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:16.759
Looking all flustered...

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:18.319
Low blood...

00:04:18.319 --> 00:04:20.000
Find a way to ask him to meet up.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:20.839
Whether for dinner

00:04:20.839 --> 00:04:21.600
or for tea,

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:23.120
you must meet him today no matter what.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:23.959
I'll go too.

00:04:30.319 --> 00:04:31.680
Did you hear what I said to you?

00:04:34.759 --> 00:04:36.199
I'm afraid it still has to be tomorrow.

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:39.040
My wife is sick. It's serious.

00:04:39.319 --> 00:04:40.560
See you tomorrow, Director Wu.

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:42.279
Come on, come on!

00:04:42.279 --> 00:04:43.199
Hurry up, hurry up!

00:04:44.519 --> 00:04:45.319
Betting 800!

00:04:45.519 --> 00:04:46.279
Place your bets, place your bets!

00:04:46.279 --> 00:04:47.879
Place your bets, place your bets!

00:04:48.279 --> 00:04:49.439
Count me in, count me in!

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:52.920
Director Xiao!

00:04:54.399 --> 00:04:55.360
What a coincidence!

00:04:56.519 --> 00:04:57.199
Boss Lin!

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.399
Come, come, come!

00:05:00.399 --> 00:05:00.920
Play a round with us!

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:01.839
Join us, join us!

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:03.120
Place your bets, place your bets!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:15.759
Take your pick.

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:19.319
Yeah, take your pick.

00:05:28.639 --> 00:05:29.680
Debts must be paid.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.000
It's only natural.

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:32.000
That's just how it is.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:35.399
Feel free to look around.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:58.680
Comrade, take a look.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:05:59.720
They're all rare editions.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.879
I definitely can't make it over today.

00:06:32.879 --> 00:06:34.240
What mission is it this time?

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.439
It was arranged in advance,

00:06:35.439 --> 00:06:36.199
and you just bail like that.

00:06:36.199 --> 00:06:37.439
Putting on airs now, are we?

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.639
What airs am I putting on?

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:41.360
I really do have a mission today.

00:06:41.519 --> 00:06:42.639
I'm right here at the scene.

00:06:42.759 --> 00:06:43.600
We're making an arrest.

00:06:43.839 --> 00:06:44.800
An arrest?

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:45.600
Who are you arresting?

00:06:46.079 --> 00:06:46.879
Talk to you later.

00:06:52.399 --> 00:06:53.199
Excuse me.

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.240
Mine is definitely the highest hand.

00:06:55.519 --> 00:06:56.600
I lose every single round.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:58.759
These beads of yours are pretty lucky.

00:06:58.879 --> 00:07:00.240
Don't touch them. Don't touch them!

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:07.480
Director Xiao, don't be so stingy.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:08.800
Share a little luck,

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.040
and it'll double!

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:10.800
Let me take a look.

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:11.959
Just one look.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.000
Where did you get them blessed?

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:15.360
I need to get a string for myself too.

00:07:15.759 --> 00:07:17.480
You've been winning right from the start.

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:18.600
Doesn't that count as cheating?

00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:20.319
Just good luck, that's all.

00:07:20.319 --> 00:07:21.399
A treasure knows its master.

00:07:21.399 --> 00:07:22.959
If you want one, burn incense yourself.

00:07:22.959 --> 00:07:24.879
Wearing someone else's drains your fortune.

00:07:25.439 --> 00:07:26.839
Don't scare me, Brother Qi.

00:07:26.839 --> 00:07:27.959
Come on, come on.

00:07:27.959 --> 00:07:28.959
To deities of all realms,

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:29.800
coming from Taiwan, China,

00:07:30.399 --> 00:07:31.439
a win-win partnership!

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:32.360
Wishing you prosperity!

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:33.240
Amitabha.

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:33.680
Get rich!

00:07:34.399 --> 00:07:35.199
Come on, let's switch seats to change luck!

00:07:35.199 --> 00:07:35.519
Thank you, thank you.

00:07:35.519 --> 00:07:35.920
You take over.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:36.600
Play a couple of rounds.

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:37.199
Sure.

00:07:37.439 --> 00:07:38.240
Prosperity to everyone!

00:07:38.319 --> 00:07:39.199
Prosperity to everyone!

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:45.920
Come on, let loose and play!

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:46.360
Okay.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:47.800
Win it back, crush him!

00:07:53.079 --> 00:07:54.000
Let's switch seats to change our luck too.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.279
I'll go wash my hands. You play.

00:08:12.959 --> 00:08:14.720
Don't tell your brother-in-law I gambled.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:15.759
Otherwise, I'm dead meat.

00:08:16.240 --> 00:08:16.759
If he finds out,

00:08:16.759 --> 00:08:18.079
my sister will kill me too.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.759
Can you stop talking while playing?

00:08:19.959 --> 00:08:21.480
Talking doesn't get in the way of playing.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:26.720
Move, right now.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:30.879
Where are we going?

00:08:34.679 --> 00:08:35.279
To make a call.

00:08:35.279 --> 00:08:36.240
And use the restroom.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.159
I'll go too. Let's go together.

00:08:43.039 --> 00:08:43.919
Tell me,

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.360
do his beads really have magical powers?

00:08:47.519 --> 00:08:48.559
With things like this,

00:08:48.559 --> 00:08:49.399
it's real if you believe in it,

00:08:49.399 --> 00:08:50.360
and it's not if you don't.

00:08:50.919 --> 00:08:51.519
Do you believe it?

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.120
Have you been here before?

00:08:54.639 --> 00:08:55.480
Yeah, I have.

00:08:55.879 --> 00:08:57.279
I was just here last week.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:08:59.919
That's why I'm sticking with you.

00:09:00.639 --> 00:09:01.519
Which way to the restroom?

00:09:01.519 --> 00:09:02.519
Straight or turn?

00:09:03.399 --> 00:09:05.279
Go straight to the end, then turn.

00:09:16.919 --> 00:09:17.600
The women's room?

00:09:19.639 --> 00:09:21.879
Hardly any women come here to gamble.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.639
We always just push the door and go in.

00:09:23.639 --> 00:09:24.279
Don't worry.

00:09:24.279 --> 00:09:25.960
Nobody's gonna call you a pervert.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.200
I gotta go number two, all right?

00:10:06.759 --> 00:10:07.879
I'll wait for you outside.

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:33.039
That guy looks suspicious. Go check him.

00:10:33.039 --> 00:10:33.519
Got it.

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:36.559
Yeah.

00:10:36.879 --> 00:10:38.519
I'm heading this way, just like you said.

00:10:38.519 --> 00:10:39.919
Yeah, right this way.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:41.720
I'll keep moving forward, then.

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:43.039
What are you doing?

00:10:43.159 --> 00:10:43.960
Sorry about that.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.720
I'm raising my hand. Do you see me?

00:10:47.879 --> 00:10:48.720
Do you see me?

00:10:49.879 --> 00:10:50.480
Alright, okay.

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:52.200
That man has a gun on him.

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.960
Stay on him. Don't let him ruin this.

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:13.279
Win money! Win, win, win!

00:11:13.399 --> 00:11:14.399
Rake it in! Take the cash!

00:11:14.519 --> 00:11:15.399
Again! Deal again!

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:16.840
Not bad!

00:11:18.639 --> 00:11:19.360
Here's a tip, a tip!

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:21.480
Thank you, boss!

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:22.639
I'm gonna take a leak.

00:11:22.639 --> 00:11:23.559
Go on, get going.

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:25.799
Win or lose, it's all on this hand.

00:11:25.799 --> 00:11:27.000
Let's raise the stakes! Come on!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:32.679
Keep this in mind.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:34.240
You can fool anyone,

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.200
but you can't fool the police.

00:11:41.679 --> 00:11:42.399
Highest hand!

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:44.399
Pardon me!

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.480
Won the pot and rushing off already?

00:11:47.679 --> 00:11:49.960
Director Xiao, we're all brothers,

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:51.360
but card games still have rules.

00:11:51.919 --> 00:11:52.799
We'll play again next time.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:54.200
Mr. Lin, Mr. Lin, Mr. Lin!

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:55.080
Little brother, buy the boys some tea.

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.000
Can you lend me some cash, please?

00:11:56.279 --> 00:11:57.399
Thanks, thank you!

00:11:58.320 --> 00:11:59.080
Little brother!

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:00.720
Can I bet this?

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:01.759
One more hand, just one more!

00:12:01.759 --> 00:12:02.200
Just one more hand!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.240
Don't roll the dice yet!

00:12:03.799 --> 00:12:04.840
Change it into RMB!

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:05.879
Get RMB for it!

00:12:06.039 --> 00:12:06.679
Bet on this! Bet on this!

00:12:06.679 --> 00:12:07.120
Come on, come on!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.080
Drag him out! Drag him out!

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.320
No, listen to me, little brother!

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:10.600
No, listen to me!

00:12:11.919 --> 00:12:12.840
My bag!

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:13.799
My bag! I dropped my bag!

00:12:13.799 --> 00:12:14.559
Dropped it!

00:12:18.639 --> 00:12:19.360
It's Ah Cai on the phone!

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:20.240
Call from Ah Cai!

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:22.000
Ah Cai!

00:12:23.159 --> 00:12:24.399
Don't mess with my father-in-law!

00:12:25.279 --> 00:12:26.440
Leaving that IOU at the government office...

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:27.440
are you trying to ruin me?

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:29.120
What good does ruining me do you?

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:30.440
Police are here!

00:12:31.519 --> 00:12:32.679
Ah Cai, you've got to believe me!

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:33.639
Police raid!

00:12:33.639 --> 00:12:34.080
Freeze!

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:34.480
Nobody move!

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:34.919
Stop right there!

00:12:34.919 --> 00:12:35.320
Get down!

00:12:38.679 --> 00:12:39.200
Police raid!

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:40.080
Police! Don't move!

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:43.679
Don't move!

00:12:44.039 --> 00:12:44.679
Squat down!

00:12:48.039 --> 00:12:49.399
How do I know you're real cops?

00:12:49.399 --> 00:12:50.480
What if you're frauds?

00:12:50.480 --> 00:12:51.080
Shut up!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:51.879
I'm telling you,

00:12:51.919 --> 00:12:53.000
I have a heart condition!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:53.840
I'm not lying to you!

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:54.799
Get over there!

00:12:54.799 --> 00:12:56.559
Squat down! Get down!

00:12:56.559 --> 00:12:57.320
Behave yourself!

00:12:57.799 --> 00:12:58.679
Take a headcount!

00:13:05.559 --> 00:13:06.080
Stop!

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:09.519
Someone fled the den! Stop him!

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:14.720
Out of the way! Move!

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:17.320
Move aside!

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:18.120
Out of the way!

00:13:19.919 --> 00:13:20.600
Coming through!

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:22.120
Get over here!

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:56.200
Stop!

00:13:59.639 --> 00:14:00.159
Xiao Jin

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.279
is our primary target today.

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:05.720
Don't lose sight of him!

00:14:07.639 --> 00:14:08.360
Out of the way!

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:10.360
Move!

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:14.200
Get out of the way!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:21.799
Stop right there!

00:14:24.799 --> 00:14:25.519
We can cut him off ahead!

00:14:25.519 --> 00:14:26.279
Go left!

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:27.879
Follow him wherever he runs!

00:14:37.279 --> 00:14:37.960
Are you all right?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.279
Hurry,

00:14:39.799 --> 00:14:40.879
go after him!

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:43.200
Should we call the police?

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:44.399
Are you okay?

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:45.639
Young man!

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:46.960
Young man!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.600
Think you can catch me like this?

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:23.120
You have to memorize the maps,

00:15:23.279 --> 00:15:24.159
and know the routes by heart.

00:15:24.679 --> 00:15:26.320
It's me, Old Xiao.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:31.879
Get in the car, quick!

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:33.039
Get in!

00:15:33.039 --> 00:15:33.679
Director Liu,

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:35.039
hold on a second.

00:15:35.159 --> 00:15:36.600
I'll put him on the phone in a moment.

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:38.440
Director Liu...

00:15:39.519 --> 00:15:40.080
Director Liu?

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.399
Your man will take the call shortly.

00:15:42.639 --> 00:15:43.440
Just a moment, hold on.

00:15:43.639 --> 00:15:44.639
Here, take the call.

00:15:49.159 --> 00:15:50.039
Director Liu.

00:15:51.919 --> 00:15:52.480
Yes, right, of course.

00:15:52.639 --> 00:15:53.240
Understood.

00:15:55.919 --> 00:15:57.000
I'm terribly sorry about this.

00:15:57.320 --> 00:15:59.240
We had no idea you were here.

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:01.000
No one notified us in advance.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.000
Why did you come here?

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:02.840
Armed, no less.

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:03.679
Who gave the order?

00:16:03.679 --> 00:16:04.960
Someone just called in a tip,

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:06.000
saying there was an underground casino,

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:06.960
and drug dealing going on.

00:16:07.279 --> 00:16:08.399
That's why we came armed.

00:16:08.799 --> 00:16:09.360
Once we get back,

00:16:09.799 --> 00:16:11.120
I'll release whoever should be let go.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.399
With so many people in the casino,

00:16:18.559 --> 00:16:20.080
how can you remember who went?

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:22.399
Everyone there is a regular.

00:16:22.639 --> 00:16:24.320
Even strangers need an introduction

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:25.720
before I'll open the door.

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:27.399
There were a lot of people,

00:16:27.759 --> 00:16:30.480
but only Boss Lin was wearing a Rolex.

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:32.399
And he's from Taiwan, China.

00:16:32.639 --> 00:16:34.559
How could I possibly forget?

00:16:34.679 --> 00:16:36.200
When was the last time he went?

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.799
What time? How many people?

00:16:42.039 --> 00:16:43.399
What about the Rolex?

00:16:43.399 --> 00:16:44.919
How's that related to your lost wallet?

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.799
It's the bald guy

00:16:46.799 --> 00:16:47.919
who was at my table.

00:16:47.919 --> 00:16:49.159
He kept staring at me.

00:16:49.159 --> 00:16:51.519
He even asked about my Rolex,

00:16:51.679 --> 00:16:53.039
asking its selling price in Taiwan, China.

00:16:53.039 --> 00:16:54.480
I bet he's the thief!

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:56.039
You said it yourself,

00:16:56.799 --> 00:16:57.840
I was dealing cards.

00:16:58.759 --> 00:16:59.759
With all those people,

00:16:59.759 --> 00:17:01.759
how could I remember what you said?

00:17:02.279 --> 00:17:03.559
It hasn't been that long.

00:17:03.679 --> 00:17:04.920
It's only been a week.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.079
How could you forget?

00:17:08.279 --> 00:17:09.519
Just now you said

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.880
you dropped your wallet right outside.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:13.759
Why should I care?

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:17.559
Look at it this way.

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:19.920
What if I track down this thief?

00:17:20.319 --> 00:17:21.759
If he steals from your place again,

00:17:21.759 --> 00:17:23.039
you'll have to deal with it then.

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:24.559
Make sure you don't forget me.

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.039
Of course I won't.

00:17:26.359 --> 00:17:27.359
I'm going, I'm going.

00:17:27.599 --> 00:17:28.119
Don't forget!

00:17:28.119 --> 00:17:29.119
All right.

00:17:30.079 --> 00:17:31.920
About... about a week ago.

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:34.319
Have you been here before?

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:37.319
Yeah, I was just here last week.

00:17:37.519 --> 00:17:38.720
He lost his wallet,

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:39.759
and came back looking for it later.

00:17:39.759 --> 00:17:43.119
Came back a few times, I can't recall.

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:45.680
Good thing we weren't with prostitutes.

00:17:46.119 --> 00:17:47.680
I heard the fine for that is even steeper.

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:50.519
Whatever we lost, we'll earn it back.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.279
Meeting the Health Bureau director tomorrow.

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:54.599
The healthcare system is cracking down,

00:17:54.839 --> 00:17:56.599
so many county hospitals won't open doors.

00:17:56.839 --> 00:17:57.759
The newly leased CT scanners

00:17:57.759 --> 00:17:59.480
and MRI machines can't be installed.

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:01.200
They're growing mushrooms in storage.

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.319
All we need is the director's signature.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:04.880
Nobody be late.

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.599
I shouldn't have gone to the bathroom.

00:18:08.839 --> 00:18:10.200
I should've pressed my luck

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:11.599
and taken Old Xiao for everything he had.

00:18:11.599 --> 00:18:12.759
If only we'd left earlier.

00:18:13.759 --> 00:18:15.680
So were you on a roll or out of luck?

00:18:16.319 --> 00:18:18.000
We'd be fine if we left one step earlier.

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.200
Yet you had to call me back.

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:20.599
We're brothers.

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:22.200
We stick together through thick and thin.

00:18:23.119 --> 00:18:24.519
This Rolex of mine—

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:25.759
it's fine underwater,

00:18:25.759 --> 00:18:26.799
but dirt will ruin it.

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:28.799
They even pinned me to the ground.

00:18:28.799 --> 00:18:30.119
What if it gets all scratched up?

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:31.839
Get a lawyer and sue them.

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:32.920
The laws on the mainland

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.480
must protect Taiwan, China compatriots!

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:36.400
You're killing a Taiwan, China compatriot!

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:46.079
Cross-Strait relations are tense lately,

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.680
and chatter at the antique market is up.

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:49.000
Spend more time poking around there.

00:18:58.839 --> 00:18:59.680
I'm sorry, Boss.

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:01.880
I failed to protect you today.

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:04.279
You did well.

00:19:04.759 --> 00:19:05.920
You stepped up when it mattered.

00:19:06.079 --> 00:19:08.000
Off the clock, we're brothers from now on.

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:10.599
Let's find a place to grab a bite.

00:19:10.599 --> 00:19:11.160
I'm hungry.

00:19:21.079 --> 00:19:22.160
Chopsticks aren't allowed in here.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.240
Afraid you'd stab yourself to death.

00:19:24.359 --> 00:19:25.440
Is there any vinegar, then?

00:19:25.759 --> 00:19:27.279
Sure, it's in the kitchen.

00:19:27.559 --> 00:19:28.720
You getting it, or should I?

00:19:31.799 --> 00:19:32.599
What about tea?

00:19:33.119 --> 00:19:35.039
I can wash it down if I choke, right?

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:36.720
If your appetite is too big,

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:38.480
eating too fast can choke you to death.

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:39.519
Such a simple truth—

00:19:39.519 --> 00:19:41.480
I taught you that the first time we met.

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:43.279
You must know how much you can stomach.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:44.319
Yet you wouldn't listen.

00:19:44.920 --> 00:19:46.559
Still, you can't just let me starve.

00:19:47.039 --> 00:19:48.839
If I starve, who's going to work with you?

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:50.920
Who's going to sit there and make contact?

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.920
Who was meeting you at the casino?

00:19:55.359 --> 00:19:57.119
You don't know the MIB Courier?

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:58.400
You never believe me.

00:19:58.759 --> 00:20:00.480
The more I know,

00:20:00.799 --> 00:20:01.680
the more money I make.

00:20:02.119 --> 00:20:02.920
Why turn down business?

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:04.880
Intel spoils if kept in your pocket.

00:20:15.720 --> 00:20:17.440
You only have business if I feed you.

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.319
You only eat when I let you.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.119
Do you think you're smart?

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:22.720
All those bits and pieces of intel...

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:24.279
If I hadn't spoon-fed it to you,

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:26.359
how could you fool the people over there?

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:30.519
As for who puts food on my plate,

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:32.240
I know very well.

00:20:33.799 --> 00:20:34.319
Sit down.

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:39.400
I screened everyone in that casino.

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:40.079
There were no issues.

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:41.599
Everything was fine, so why did you run?

00:20:41.759 --> 00:20:43.000
Don't give me your bullshit.

00:20:43.079 --> 00:20:43.839
Who knows if you were going to

00:20:43.839 --> 00:20:45.200
take a boat and flee to the other side?

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:46.680
Owing that much money,

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:47.920
I'd run too if I were you.

00:20:48.119 --> 00:20:49.599
If our men hadn't pinned you down,

00:20:49.599 --> 00:20:51.079
would we still be talking here right now?

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:53.319
There were guns, Brother Qi!

00:20:53.319 --> 00:20:54.839
Didn't you hear the gunshots?

00:20:54.839 --> 00:20:57.200
My legs are still shaking right now.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:58.440
Who wouldn't be scared except you?

00:20:58.440 --> 00:20:59.920
I nearly snapped those beads rubbing them!

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:01.680
No one showed up, what was I to do?

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:05.720
The police raided the gambling den!

00:21:06.279 --> 00:21:07.200
If the police hadn't raided it,

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:08.279
maybe they would have shown up.

00:21:08.279 --> 00:21:09.680
Either they got stuck in traffic,

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:11.240
or the police raid scared them off.

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:12.480
Think about it, doesn't that make sense?

00:21:22.559 --> 00:21:23.720
There's no money this time.

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:26.200
Funds are tight.

00:21:31.559 --> 00:21:33.319
If you were working only for me,

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:34.480
I'd treat you like a brother.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:35.880
You want money? Fine.

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:37.920
I'd even risk my life for you.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:39.039
But now?

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.920
It's like taking a wife,

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:43.359
only to get cheated on countless times.

00:21:43.359 --> 00:21:44.519
Yet you're still lying to me.

00:21:45.519 --> 00:21:47.119
How many times have I told you?

00:21:47.119 --> 00:21:47.920
Keep gambling,

00:21:48.519 --> 00:21:49.440
and we're all finished.

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:55.440
Then when...

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:57.720
can I leave?

00:22:00.839 --> 00:22:02.559
For someone in the shadows like you?

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:04.839
Past midnight.

00:22:08.200 --> 00:22:09.519
Get close to those masters of yours

00:22:09.839 --> 00:22:11.319
and dig up some valuable intel.

00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:12.680
Don't try to fool me with small fry.

00:22:13.079 --> 00:22:13.880
I want the big fish.

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:23.880
Aren't they from Division Two
and the Discipline and Inspection Committee?

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:25.160
What's the big rush?

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:26.000
What's so urgent?

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:27.359
Are they here to arrest someone?

00:22:27.440 --> 00:22:28.799
Arrest one of our own?

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:30.079
Who are they after?

00:22:34.680 --> 00:22:36.440
What... what are you doing?

00:22:36.640 --> 00:22:38.319
Let's head back and talk things over.

00:22:38.400 --> 00:22:38.799
Don't move!

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:39.440
What is this?

00:22:39.440 --> 00:22:40.559
Why are you grabbing me?

00:22:40.559 --> 00:22:41.039
Move.

00:22:41.559 --> 00:22:42.160
Back off! Back off!

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:44.559
Instructor Wu, what's going on?

00:22:47.559 --> 00:22:50.240
The Antique Street phone booth was staked out.

00:22:50.599 --> 00:22:52.799
It was a trap set for thieves.

00:22:55.279 --> 00:22:57.119
Never thought you'd walk right into it.

00:22:57.119 --> 00:22:58.039
I'm Wu Jifeng!

00:22:58.519 --> 00:23:00.079
I really was on an operation today.

00:23:00.240 --> 00:23:01.440
I was right there on the scene.

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:02.480
We were going to make an arrest.

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:03.440
An arrest?

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:03.960
Arrest who?

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:04.640
I couldn't just stay on the phone

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:06.000
with you guys for that long.

00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:07.759
"There's heat. Plan's changed."

00:23:10.319 --> 00:23:12.119
I've been wound tight the whole time.

00:23:14.759 --> 00:23:17.000
I couldn't even drop my guard in my sleep.

00:23:17.200 --> 00:23:19.720
My family was poor when I was growing up.

00:23:19.839 --> 00:23:21.480
Landing this job

00:23:21.480 --> 00:23:23.599
was my proudest achievement.

00:23:23.599 --> 00:23:25.359
Yet I couldn't tell a soul.

00:23:25.839 --> 00:23:27.759
So I bought clothes and shoes,

00:23:27.759 --> 00:23:29.160
bought nice watches,

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:31.400
just to show people I'd made it.

00:23:32.279 --> 00:23:33.839
But when it came to work,

00:23:33.839 --> 00:23:35.640
I stayed vigilant the entire time.

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:40.160
I only slipped up this once.

00:23:40.160 --> 00:23:42.039
Some stay vigilant their entire lives,

00:23:42.680 --> 00:23:44.759
yet letting their guard down just once

00:23:45.880 --> 00:23:48.559
let a long-watched suspect slip away.

00:23:48.920 --> 00:23:50.160
It was my mistake.

00:23:51.960 --> 00:23:53.400
I deserve the blame.

00:23:53.799 --> 00:23:55.000
It was all because of me

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:56.839
that the operation went wrong.

00:23:56.839 --> 00:23:59.960
I'll willingly take any punishment.

00:24:00.079 --> 00:24:01.079
However...

00:24:01.440 --> 00:24:03.319
Recruits are chosen one in a hundred,

00:24:03.319 --> 00:24:04.519
one in a thousand.

00:24:05.680 --> 00:24:06.720
It's not just about test scores.

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:08.759
Other qualities matter too.

00:24:12.079 --> 00:24:13.000
Chief Wei...

00:24:13.359 --> 00:24:15.359
Chief Wei, please give me one more chance.

00:24:15.359 --> 00:24:16.559
Please don't dismiss me.

00:24:16.880 --> 00:24:17.319
Chief Wei...

00:24:17.319 --> 00:24:18.880
I want to stay in State Security.

00:24:19.319 --> 00:24:20.200
Instructor Wu...

00:24:20.640 --> 00:24:21.960
Instructor Wu, I'm begging you.

00:24:21.960 --> 00:24:23.880
Please give me another chance.

00:24:24.039 --> 00:24:25.160
Instructor Wu...

00:24:25.519 --> 00:24:27.480
I'm begging you.

00:24:27.720 --> 00:24:28.839
I beg you.

00:24:31.559 --> 00:24:32.200
It's been confirmed.

00:24:33.039 --> 00:24:35.480
Poor security awareness. He leaked it.

00:24:36.079 --> 00:24:36.680
Sit down.

00:24:44.039 --> 00:24:46.119
That's why my mother always said,

00:24:46.200 --> 00:24:47.920
mere words teach nothing;

00:24:49.640 --> 00:24:51.839
only hard lessons stick.

00:24:52.079 --> 00:24:52.920
Just like children.

00:24:52.920 --> 00:24:55.079
You tell them to brush, they don't listen.

00:24:55.319 --> 00:24:57.240
One toothache, and they never forget.

00:24:57.240 --> 00:24:58.720
Unfortunately, in this compound,

00:24:58.720 --> 00:25:00.119
the price of not listening is too high.

00:25:00.480 --> 00:25:02.920
Toothache? Are you talking about me?

00:25:04.680 --> 00:25:05.920
I originally thought

00:25:06.359 --> 00:25:07.440
the leak came from

00:25:08.240 --> 00:25:10.240
the mole we've been looking for.

00:25:11.519 --> 00:25:12.359
Play another round.

00:25:13.599 --> 00:25:15.279
What do you think of Yang Shiwen?

00:25:15.480 --> 00:25:17.079
He feeds off all sides.

00:25:17.440 --> 00:25:18.279
Can he be controlled?

00:25:18.279 --> 00:25:20.519
Most of what he says is true.

00:25:20.680 --> 00:25:22.200
Then the one who paid and picked up goods

00:25:22.200 --> 00:25:23.400
at the casino, why wasn't it Yang Shiwen?

00:25:24.000 --> 00:25:25.640
Who was it? Lin Kanshan.

00:25:26.759 --> 00:25:27.799
The MIB...

00:25:28.559 --> 00:25:29.880
must also be tallying their losses.

00:25:30.359 --> 00:25:32.480
Since Operation Spring Thunder's prelude,

00:25:32.519 --> 00:25:33.920
Xiamen and Quanzhou

00:25:34.039 --> 00:25:35.079
suddenly rounded up

00:25:35.079 --> 00:25:36.519
over a dozen of their embedded operatives.

00:25:36.519 --> 00:25:37.400
Minzhong State Security Bureau.

00:25:37.640 --> 00:25:38.119
Brother.

00:25:41.359 --> 00:25:42.200
Minzhong State Security Bureau.

00:25:42.519 --> 00:25:44.200
Hello, Minzhong State Security Bureau.

00:25:45.559 --> 00:25:47.079
Yang Shiwen is buried deep

00:25:47.240 --> 00:25:48.079
and is far more valuable,

00:25:48.480 --> 00:25:50.759
so they sent Lin Kanshan to meet Old Xiao.

00:25:51.359 --> 00:25:52.480
And things went sideways.

00:25:53.480 --> 00:25:54.559
That's just my personal theory.

00:25:55.200 --> 00:25:56.519
We didn't catch the mole this time,

00:25:56.519 --> 00:25:57.799
so we'll just keep hunting.

00:25:58.000 --> 00:25:58.720
People get anxious.

00:25:59.039 --> 00:26:00.799
We can't start suspecting one another.

00:26:01.079 --> 00:26:02.519
Someone even suspected Chunxiao.

00:26:02.720 --> 00:26:04.279
He's been cleared. It's not him.

00:26:04.279 --> 00:26:05.720
Then put his mind at ease.

00:26:06.039 --> 00:26:07.480
We must protect good talent.

00:26:07.640 --> 00:26:08.160
By the way,

00:26:08.200 --> 00:26:09.559
regarding the missile leak,

00:26:10.240 --> 00:26:12.480
Beijing Bureau confirmed Institute 761.

00:26:12.680 --> 00:26:13.640
Cao Liaoping

00:26:14.440 --> 00:26:15.240
or Jia Chunlin.

00:26:15.240 --> 00:26:16.400
It has to be one of them.

00:26:16.720 --> 00:26:17.680
They're under surveillance now.

00:26:17.680 --> 00:26:19.240
But surveillance isn't foolproof.

00:26:19.440 --> 00:26:20.599
Until we find the mole,

00:26:21.599 --> 00:26:22.319
I can't rest easy.

00:26:25.799 --> 00:26:26.839
He's an old hand.

00:26:26.839 --> 00:26:27.880
He doesn't transmit easily.

00:26:28.200 --> 00:26:29.160
He's buried too deep.

00:26:29.160 --> 00:26:30.319
The problem right now

00:26:30.319 --> 00:26:31.559
is that we're shorthanded.

00:26:31.680 --> 00:26:33.440
We're stretched thin on this board.

00:26:33.440 --> 00:26:34.680
Huadong is another problem.

00:26:34.920 --> 00:26:36.279
The hospital called and said

00:26:36.440 --> 00:26:38.000
he'll be bedridden for three months.

00:26:38.400 --> 00:26:40.680
He was supposed to team up with Jinlan

00:26:40.960 --> 00:26:43.079
to pose as a couple and bug Lin Kanshan.

00:26:43.519 --> 00:26:44.640
Now that will have to change.

00:26:44.880 --> 00:26:47.079
Having an injured soccer-playing boyfriend

00:26:47.079 --> 00:26:47.960
recovering at home—

00:26:47.960 --> 00:26:49.119
wouldn't that look natural?

00:26:49.119 --> 00:26:50.240
During the day, Jinlan

00:26:50.240 --> 00:26:51.440
still has to go to the travel agency.

00:26:51.440 --> 00:26:53.720
She can't watch a roaming neighbor alone.

00:26:59.680 --> 00:27:01.119
I remember when you first joined the Bureau,

00:27:01.119 --> 00:27:03.000
were you set up, or was it romance?

00:27:03.000 --> 00:27:04.400
It was with Li Fengge, wasn't it?

00:27:04.799 --> 00:27:06.000
When was that?

00:27:07.720 --> 00:27:08.640
She's a young woman.

00:27:09.960 --> 00:27:11.319
If she doesn't date around,

00:27:11.319 --> 00:27:13.240
how will she know who's right for her?

00:27:13.480 --> 00:27:14.119
Replace him.

00:27:14.119 --> 00:27:15.000
Replace him with whom?

00:27:26.920 --> 00:27:27.359
Understood.

00:27:29.079 --> 00:27:30.720
Huadong's eyes are having problems, too.

00:27:32.079 --> 00:27:32.920
Is it serious?

00:27:34.000 --> 00:27:35.519
It'll be hard to recover anytime soon.

00:27:37.000 --> 00:27:38.359
Boss, you have no idea.

00:27:39.319 --> 00:27:40.599
As for Jin Lina,

00:27:40.920 --> 00:27:42.599
she's way too stubborn.

00:27:43.000 --> 00:27:45.839
She seems pretty carefree normally, right?

00:27:46.599 --> 00:27:49.599
Yet over the tiniest little things,

00:27:49.599 --> 00:27:50.920
she just can't let them go.

00:27:51.079 --> 00:27:52.200
She really holds a grudge.

00:27:52.880 --> 00:27:55.519
Her family treated her badly,

00:27:55.720 --> 00:27:57.160
so she doesn't go home for New Year's.

00:27:57.599 --> 00:27:58.319
How so?

00:27:58.839 --> 00:27:59.720
Favoring sons over daughters?

00:28:01.680 --> 00:28:02.599
Not entirely.

00:28:03.319 --> 00:28:04.799
Her father passed away early.

00:28:04.799 --> 00:28:05.680
Heart disease.

00:28:06.079 --> 00:28:08.000
Later, her mother remarried.

00:28:08.599 --> 00:28:10.680
Her stepdad brought two kids of his own.

00:28:11.319 --> 00:28:12.519
Why do I feel like

00:28:13.240 --> 00:28:15.279
her relationship with her aunt is odd?

00:28:21.359 --> 00:28:22.119
It's hard to talk about.

00:28:22.119 --> 00:28:23.599
Something must be really messed up.

00:28:25.759 --> 00:28:26.799
No, not that.

00:28:27.920 --> 00:28:29.680
There's nothing wrong with her aunt.

00:28:30.160 --> 00:28:31.160
It's her uncle.

00:28:31.160 --> 00:28:33.039
That uncle of hers is a total scumbag.

00:28:33.240 --> 00:28:34.559
He can't handle his liquor.

00:28:34.559 --> 00:28:36.519
Once he drinks, he turns into a maniac.

00:28:37.039 --> 00:28:37.759
A maniac.

00:28:37.759 --> 00:28:38.759
Once, after drinking,

00:28:38.759 --> 00:28:40.119
he tried to force himself on Jin Lina.

00:28:40.119 --> 00:28:41.440
Her aunt caught him in time,

00:28:41.440 --> 00:28:43.200
so he didn't succeed.

00:28:45.079 --> 00:28:46.319
That's why she refuses to go back.

00:28:49.559 --> 00:28:51.440
I've met him a few times.

00:28:52.000 --> 00:28:54.799
He always puts on a respectable facade.

00:28:55.559 --> 00:28:56.119
I tell you,

00:28:56.119 --> 00:28:57.640
if Jin Lina hadn't held me back,

00:28:57.640 --> 00:28:59.799
I would've beaten him up multiple times.

00:29:03.960 --> 00:29:05.119
The worse off he is,

00:29:06.400 --> 00:29:07.759
the happier I'll be.

00:29:12.440 --> 00:29:13.920
Do you know how someone like him

00:29:14.359 --> 00:29:15.640
can be brought down?

00:29:17.599 --> 00:29:19.319
Especially given his status?

00:29:25.160 --> 00:29:26.039
Leaking secrets.

00:29:26.519 --> 00:29:27.799
What kind of leak?

00:29:28.119 --> 00:29:29.559
That's for you to figure out.

00:29:31.200 --> 00:29:33.680
You know the mainland's ins and outs best.

00:29:46.759 --> 00:29:47.920
What is State Security?

00:29:48.559 --> 00:29:50.480
From the second you start work,

00:29:50.680 --> 00:29:52.440
you can't say a single extra word.

00:29:52.839 --> 00:29:54.279
First to arrive at the office every day,

00:29:54.440 --> 00:29:55.680
and the last to leave.

00:29:56.240 --> 00:29:58.519
Yet your own people just suspect you.

00:29:58.880 --> 00:30:00.440
That's what State Security is.

00:30:01.400 --> 00:30:02.640
I don't feel wronged.

00:30:03.200 --> 00:30:04.960
Why feel wronged about being suspected?

00:30:05.880 --> 00:30:07.680
But if Old Xiao wasn't caught this time,

00:30:07.680 --> 00:30:08.640
I wouldn't even have had

00:30:08.640 --> 00:30:10.160
a chance to prove my innocence.

00:30:30.240 --> 00:30:31.519
Why didn't you chase him when he ran?

00:30:31.519 --> 00:30:32.519
If I were the leader,

00:30:32.799 --> 00:30:33.799
I'd suspect you.

00:30:35.440 --> 00:30:36.559
Can't even say if you're leaving?

00:30:37.200 --> 00:30:38.640
We're all on the same side.

00:30:38.640 --> 00:30:39.799
Don't be like the "MIB,"

00:30:39.799 --> 00:30:40.920
guarding against their own people.

00:30:40.920 --> 00:30:42.039
Who's guarding against whom?

00:30:45.880 --> 00:30:47.279
You really are a strange person.

00:30:47.680 --> 00:30:48.599
Hard to read.

00:30:49.559 --> 00:30:50.599
Can't tell a thing.

00:30:54.359 --> 00:30:55.880
There's a veil between us.

00:30:56.359 --> 00:30:58.559
It's time to pierce it today.

00:30:59.079 --> 00:31:02.240
The division heard suspicions about you.

00:31:02.759 --> 00:31:04.359
After repeated checks,

00:31:04.559 --> 00:31:06.559
facts stopped the rumors.

00:31:07.000 --> 00:31:08.599
You're in the clear.

00:31:14.319 --> 00:31:15.359
Hello, Second Division.

00:31:16.279 --> 00:31:17.160
I've heard.

00:31:17.640 --> 00:31:19.279
I did suspect you before.

00:31:20.079 --> 00:31:21.920
We're not playing house here.

00:31:22.200 --> 00:31:23.720
This is our job.

00:31:23.720 --> 00:31:25.480
If something seems off about you later,

00:31:25.759 --> 00:31:26.920
I'll suspect you all the same.

00:31:27.440 --> 00:31:28.720
If there's ever a problem with me,

00:31:28.720 --> 00:31:30.240
you're welcome to suspect me too.

00:31:31.160 --> 00:31:32.359
I apologize to you.

00:31:32.799 --> 00:31:33.680
Formally.

00:31:35.240 --> 00:31:37.000
Fine if Huadong doesn't trust me,

00:31:39.119 --> 00:31:40.079
but you don't trust me either.

00:31:40.359 --> 00:31:42.880
He Chunxiao, let me tell you a truth.

00:32:03.480 --> 00:32:04.119
You're back.

00:32:13.599 --> 00:32:14.599
Don't bother checking.

00:32:14.599 --> 00:32:16.079
Those little tricks you left behind,

00:32:16.680 --> 00:32:18.279
even a petty pickpocket could bypass them.

00:32:18.759 --> 00:32:19.240
Sit.

00:32:42.799 --> 00:32:43.799
It's my family's own liquor.

00:32:44.079 --> 00:32:46.000
I've kept it stored for ten years.

00:32:46.000 --> 00:32:46.920
Aren't you having some?

00:33:00.759 --> 00:33:01.400
Not bad.

00:33:03.240 --> 00:33:03.880
Good liquor.

00:33:05.000 --> 00:33:06.279
Do you suspect me too?

00:33:08.200 --> 00:33:08.880
In Beijing,

00:33:09.480 --> 00:33:10.519
at Capital Airport,

00:33:10.720 --> 00:33:11.599
when you went to the restroom,

00:33:11.599 --> 00:33:13.200
someone from Taiwan, China spoke to me.

00:33:13.200 --> 00:33:13.759
"Young man,

00:33:14.079 --> 00:33:15.000
may I ask you something?

00:33:15.000 --> 00:33:17.319
Do you know where the luggage storage is?"

00:33:17.559 --> 00:33:18.319
"I don't know.

00:33:18.319 --> 00:33:19.480
It should be outside."

00:33:19.839 --> 00:33:21.599
You just watched me from a distance,

00:33:21.960 --> 00:33:22.839
suspecting me.

00:33:23.279 --> 00:33:24.400
If you had doubts in your mind,

00:33:24.400 --> 00:33:26.000
why didn't you dare to ask?

00:33:26.720 --> 00:33:28.240
A guilty conscience suspects everyone.

00:33:28.839 --> 00:33:30.000
All the doubts are in your head.

00:33:30.119 --> 00:33:31.079
Just say them all.

00:33:39.640 --> 00:33:41.680
The numbers on here, besides the dates,

00:33:41.680 --> 00:33:43.079
are street names and house numbers.

00:33:44.240 --> 00:33:45.599
I made up the symbols.

00:33:46.319 --> 00:33:47.640
The triangle is Lin Kanshan.

00:33:48.039 --> 00:33:49.279
The circle is his secretary.

00:33:49.759 --> 00:33:50.880
The square is the mailman.

00:33:50.880 --> 00:33:52.079
The club is Lu Zhifei.

00:33:52.240 --> 00:33:52.920
The heart is you.

00:33:53.400 --> 00:33:55.880
The star is Lao Wei's tasks and orders.

00:33:58.480 --> 00:33:59.640
Since I was told to remember,

00:34:00.480 --> 00:34:01.640
I had to make sure I remembered.

00:34:04.079 --> 00:34:05.680
I had to resort to this clumsy method.

00:34:18.480 --> 00:34:20.599
This is a quick-memory trick I made up,

00:34:21.239 --> 00:34:23.199
not a code from a Taiwan, China spy.

00:34:35.679 --> 00:34:36.679
You really feel wronged, don't you?

00:34:37.519 --> 00:34:38.440
Come, talk to me.

00:34:38.639 --> 00:34:39.519
What does feeling wronged mean to you?

00:34:41.199 --> 00:34:42.079
Be specific.

00:34:42.320 --> 00:34:43.639
What does it feel like?

00:34:44.039 --> 00:34:46.320
Indignant. Fuming inside.

00:34:46.440 --> 00:34:48.239
Thinking about it makes me want to quit.

00:34:48.639 --> 00:34:49.639
Quitting would be fine, too.

00:34:49.960 --> 00:34:51.360
State Security isn't for the thin-skinned.

00:34:51.519 --> 00:34:52.880
Take off that uniform and leave,

00:34:52.880 --> 00:34:53.880
and you can do whatever you want.

00:34:54.079 --> 00:34:54.960
I didn't say I was quitting.

00:34:58.480 --> 00:34:59.400
Let me test you with a question.

00:35:04.639 --> 00:35:05.679
The last one arrested in Taiwan, China—

00:35:05.679 --> 00:35:07.440
name the last CPC underground Courier.

00:35:09.400 --> 00:35:09.960
I don't know.

00:35:10.760 --> 00:35:11.960
Remember this name.

00:35:14.800 --> 00:35:15.480
Liu Qingshi.

00:35:18.920 --> 00:35:20.440
The only person I truly admire.

00:35:20.800 --> 00:35:22.360
He secretly joined the Party at 24.

00:35:22.440 --> 00:35:24.599
Between Taiwan, China's underground Party
and the East China Bureau,

00:35:24.599 --> 00:35:26.599
nearly all contact relied on him.

00:35:26.840 --> 00:35:28.920
During the 1949 KMT massacres,

00:35:29.280 --> 00:35:30.960
he narrowly escaped to Hong Kong, China,

00:35:31.320 --> 00:35:32.719
only to be ordered back to Taiwan, China.

00:35:33.719 --> 00:35:34.960
But his superior defected.

00:35:36.519 --> 00:35:37.199
What could he do?

00:35:38.000 --> 00:35:38.599
He had to run.

00:35:39.280 --> 00:35:41.519
In Taiwan, China, with four comrades,

00:35:42.119 --> 00:35:44.079
he hid in a graveyard outside Taipei.

00:35:44.760 --> 00:35:46.159
What kind of life was that?

00:35:46.159 --> 00:35:47.800
A life worse than a ghost's.

00:35:48.000 --> 00:35:50.199
Eating rats, roots, sleeping in coffins.

00:35:50.440 --> 00:35:51.559
He hid there for four whole years.

00:35:55.000 --> 00:35:56.360
Later, someone couldn't hold out anymore

00:35:56.440 --> 00:35:57.360
and went down the mountain to surrender.

00:35:57.599 --> 00:35:59.440
The rest were arrested immediately

00:35:59.679 --> 00:36:00.480
and thrown into prison.

00:36:00.880 --> 00:36:02.280
Once inside, he realized

00:36:02.280 --> 00:36:03.719
his wife was also locked up there.

00:36:04.360 --> 00:36:05.519
Her hair had already turned white.

00:36:06.079 --> 00:36:07.400
Then came brutal torture.

00:36:07.400 --> 00:36:08.960
Endure agony unless you turned traitor.

00:36:08.960 --> 00:36:10.199
Everyone else broke.

00:36:10.199 --> 00:36:11.280
Only he held out.

00:36:12.639 --> 00:36:13.719
Even his mother berated him,

00:36:14.039 --> 00:36:15.079
"Liu Qingshi,

00:36:15.480 --> 00:36:16.920
everyone else confessed!

00:36:17.000 --> 00:36:18.480
Just talk and you'll be fine!

00:36:18.800 --> 00:36:20.280
Why won't you talk?

00:36:20.559 --> 00:36:21.920
How can you be so cruel?

00:36:22.199 --> 00:36:23.639
You unfilial wretch!"

00:36:24.880 --> 00:36:25.639
After a year in prison,

00:36:26.239 --> 00:36:27.079
the Kuomintang approached him,

00:36:28.639 --> 00:36:30.079
saying if he went to the mainland

00:36:30.400 --> 00:36:32.119
and gathered intel using his identity,

00:36:32.440 --> 00:36:33.039
his past would be forgiven.

00:36:35.960 --> 00:36:36.639
I often wonder,

00:36:36.639 --> 00:36:37.920
if I were in his shoes,

00:36:38.320 --> 00:36:39.440
what could I have done?

00:36:40.119 --> 00:36:41.199
What an impossible dilemma.

00:36:41.599 --> 00:36:42.800
Either face the organization's distrust,

00:36:43.119 --> 00:36:44.400
and Taiwan, China gets you killed by them,

00:36:44.800 --> 00:36:45.800
or become a traitor,

00:36:46.119 --> 00:36:47.800
nailed to the pillar of shame forever.

00:36:48.559 --> 00:36:49.320
And then?

00:36:52.639 --> 00:36:53.599
He made up his mind.

00:36:53.840 --> 00:36:54.880
To return to the mainland,

00:36:55.239 --> 00:36:56.719
and explain everything about his past.

00:36:57.840 --> 00:36:59.119
If it were me, I'd have gone back too.

00:36:59.800 --> 00:37:01.480
It was the only choice left for me too.

00:37:03.719 --> 00:37:05.480
He wrote over 100,000 words of statements.

00:37:05.719 --> 00:37:07.079
After a year of investigation,

00:37:07.400 --> 00:37:09.199
he was sent to a farm outside Beijing.

00:37:09.559 --> 00:37:10.639
Not quite a criminal,

00:37:11.000 --> 00:37:12.000
yet his identity couldn't be confirmed.

00:37:12.280 --> 00:37:13.360
Unable to reveal his past,

00:37:13.599 --> 00:37:14.920
unable to make a single friend,

00:37:15.519 --> 00:37:16.559
he had to live like the walking dead.

00:37:16.760 --> 00:37:18.039
Like a convict doing forced labor.

00:37:18.039 --> 00:37:19.639
And there he stayed for another 22 years.

00:37:19.880 --> 00:37:21.440
He was 56 when he finally left the farm,

00:37:21.800 --> 00:37:23.599
assigned as a foreign language teacher.

00:37:24.360 --> 00:37:25.800
Finally, he could contact his wife.

00:37:25.800 --> 00:37:27.159
So he hurriedly wrote to her.

00:37:27.679 --> 00:37:28.800
When the reply came,

00:37:29.000 --> 00:37:29.760
his wife said,

00:37:30.599 --> 00:37:31.400
"I don't know him.

00:37:31.639 --> 00:37:32.559
I've never heard of anyone

00:37:32.559 --> 00:37:33.960
by the name of Liu Qingshi."

00:37:34.280 --> 00:37:35.559
She cut all ties with him.

00:37:36.159 --> 00:37:37.360
Only later did he find out

00:37:37.599 --> 00:37:39.199
she had taken their children to the US.

00:37:40.679 --> 00:37:41.159
Well, then.

00:37:42.000 --> 00:37:43.760
If his wife denied him, he'd honor his roots.

00:37:44.800 --> 00:37:46.800
He flew to Taiwan, China to sweep his parents' graves.

00:37:47.039 --> 00:37:48.519
His relatives, brothers, and in-laws

00:37:48.519 --> 00:37:49.519
were all waiting at the airport.

00:37:50.000 --> 00:37:51.360
When his flight was delayed,

00:37:51.360 --> 00:37:52.760
they thought he'd been arrested again.

00:37:53.039 --> 00:37:53.840
And just like that,

00:37:54.000 --> 00:37:54.800
they all scattered.

00:37:55.360 --> 00:37:57.039
In 1983, he was finally rehabilitated.

00:37:57.320 --> 00:37:58.760
The old man returned to Beijing,

00:37:58.880 --> 00:37:59.760
without a trace of bitterness.

00:38:00.840 --> 00:38:02.320
A man born in Taiwan, China,

00:38:02.960 --> 00:38:03.800
chose to be buried

00:38:03.800 --> 00:38:05.280
in the mainland when his time came.

00:38:05.480 --> 00:38:06.559
I even met him once.

00:38:06.920 --> 00:38:08.679
He lived in a neighborhood in Chaoyang.

00:38:08.880 --> 00:38:10.760
Taking a walk outside early every morning,

00:38:10.760 --> 00:38:12.280
none of his neighbors had any idea

00:38:12.280 --> 00:38:13.320
what he used to do,

00:38:13.320 --> 00:38:14.239
the hardships he'd endured,

00:38:14.239 --> 00:38:15.239
or the pain he'd suffered.

00:38:15.960 --> 00:38:16.840
Nobody knew.

00:38:17.159 --> 00:38:18.639
Decades, an entire lifetime,

00:38:18.639 --> 00:38:19.880
through life and death,

00:38:20.119 --> 00:38:22.400
he carried all that injustice alone.

00:38:25.360 --> 00:38:26.639
If I were Wu Shenglai,

00:38:26.639 --> 00:38:28.440
I'd bring him here from Beijing

00:38:28.440 --> 00:38:29.519
to tell you all about it.

00:38:29.519 --> 00:38:30.639
To tell you about the mountains,

00:38:30.880 --> 00:38:33.119
and his thousand brutal days in the graveyard.

00:38:33.119 --> 00:38:33.800
At gunpoint,

00:38:33.800 --> 00:38:34.360
dodging bullets,

00:38:34.360 --> 00:38:35.239
risking his life,

00:38:35.400 --> 00:38:37.440
eating rats, roots, sleeping in coffins...

00:38:37.440 --> 00:38:39.039
How he survived those harrowing days,

00:38:39.039 --> 00:38:41.360
how he endured decades of confinement.

00:38:41.559 --> 00:38:42.880
No grand speeches are needed.

00:38:43.280 --> 00:38:44.280
Just look at him.

00:38:44.480 --> 00:38:45.440
You could even ask him,

00:38:45.559 --> 00:38:47.039
"Why didn't you protest your innocence?

00:38:47.239 --> 00:38:48.800
Why didn't you feel wronged?

00:38:49.400 --> 00:38:50.199
Why?"

00:38:57.840 --> 00:38:59.639
Misunderstandings cause many grievances.

00:39:00.440 --> 00:39:01.880
Others see you out partying every night,

00:39:02.880 --> 00:39:05.000
but we drink till our stomachs bleed for intel.

00:39:05.280 --> 00:39:06.079
Are you going to explain that to them?

00:39:08.119 --> 00:39:10.039
Can't handle being wronged? Don't join State Security.

00:39:10.199 --> 00:39:12.960
Abroad, I used to have a whole entourage,

00:39:13.079 --> 00:39:14.840
yet back here eating at the cafeteria,

00:39:14.840 --> 00:39:16.280
I had to put up with the cook's attitude.

00:39:16.280 --> 00:39:18.079
Only in a good mood would he give an extra scoop.

00:39:18.079 --> 00:39:20.440
One shake, two out of three pork cubes drop.

00:39:21.119 --> 00:39:22.679
All the hard work you did out there,

00:39:22.920 --> 00:39:23.880
all the respect you earned,

00:39:24.199 --> 00:39:25.199
meant nothing at all.

00:39:30.639 --> 00:39:33.039
Life is like driving a car.

00:39:33.760 --> 00:39:35.079
Which road you want to take

00:39:35.079 --> 00:39:36.800
isn't for you to decide.

00:39:36.800 --> 00:39:38.079
The organization is the traffic light.

00:39:38.360 --> 00:39:39.679
If you can't take it, get out of the car.

00:39:39.679 --> 00:39:40.679
It's that simple.

00:39:43.280 --> 00:39:44.360
Right now, you're acting as a shield.

00:39:44.679 --> 00:39:46.199
What if one day you have to be a spear?

00:39:46.639 --> 00:39:48.079
Wouldn't that count as a grievance, too?

00:39:50.800 --> 00:39:52.320
Life's choices are indeed tough.

00:39:52.840 --> 00:39:55.039
Fulfilling your true worth to the fullest,

00:39:55.519 --> 00:39:57.320
and just living like a walking corpse,

00:39:58.039 --> 00:39:59.320
which one makes more sense?

00:40:00.119 --> 00:40:01.159
Which would you choose?

00:40:05.159 --> 00:40:06.480
Did I talk too much?

00:40:06.480 --> 00:40:08.760
Does this make you feel even more wronged?

00:40:11.679 --> 00:40:13.360
Stop embarrassing me.

00:40:15.239 --> 00:40:16.199
Huadong is injured.

00:40:17.079 --> 00:40:17.880
It's very serious.

00:40:18.800 --> 00:40:19.599
Get ready.

00:40:19.800 --> 00:40:21.119
From now on, the one dating Jinlan

00:40:21.440 --> 00:40:22.559
will have to be you.

00:40:24.719 --> 00:40:26.719
She can't handle long-term wiretapping alone.

00:40:27.199 --> 00:40:29.039
To bait a crafty fish like Lin Kanshan,

00:40:29.039 --> 00:40:31.079
who knows if it'll take 8 or 10 years?

00:40:31.559 --> 00:40:33.039
This fake relationship—

00:40:33.039 --> 00:40:34.559
you have to do it, like it or not.

00:40:35.559 --> 00:40:36.920
How could Huadong be seriously injured?

00:40:37.039 --> 00:40:38.280
When we chased Old Xiao that day,

00:40:38.280 --> 00:40:39.800
I saw him merely trip.

00:40:40.119 --> 00:40:41.199
Nothing is impossible.

00:40:42.000 --> 00:40:43.880
Maybe one day it'll be you, or me.

00:40:44.039 --> 00:40:46.079
Put away that cheap sympathy of yours.

00:40:46.639 --> 00:40:47.920
Sacrifice, just like grievance,

00:40:48.239 --> 00:40:49.760
is an inevitable price to pay.

00:40:49.760 --> 00:40:50.480
It's fate.

00:40:50.719 --> 00:40:51.519
What do you mean, "fate"?

00:40:51.840 --> 00:40:53.079
What do you mean, "cheap sympathy"?

00:40:53.079 --> 00:40:55.159
My very first training lesson was compassion.

00:40:59.159 --> 00:41:00.519
Say you're ordered to tail someone,

00:41:00.519 --> 00:41:01.440
and you cannot intervene.

00:41:01.639 --> 00:41:03.599
As you watch him sink into the abyss,

00:41:04.119 --> 00:41:04.880
do you save him or not?

00:41:10.559 --> 00:41:12.079
Want to be a saint? Don't join State Security.

00:41:12.920 --> 00:41:13.639
Go be a doctor instead.

00:41:14.039 --> 00:41:15.159
Character determines destiny.

00:41:19.039 --> 00:41:20.559
A lot of things are predestined.

00:41:21.000 --> 00:41:22.320
Once you reach my age,

00:41:22.880 --> 00:41:23.760
you'll understand.

00:41:47.920 --> 00:41:49.039
Is that Chunxiao?

00:42:27.280 --> 00:42:28.079
Boss Lin.

00:42:28.519 --> 00:42:29.400
Let's play this.

00:42:29.400 --> 00:42:29.920
Sure.

00:42:30.360 --> 00:42:31.519
Place your bets, place your bets!

00:42:31.920 --> 00:42:33.360
Count me in! Count me in!

00:42:39.800 --> 00:42:41.719
The bracelet is proof; take the medicine tomorrow.

00:42:41.960 --> 00:42:42.599
Where'd you get them blessed?

00:42:42.880 --> 00:42:43.960
I should get a string blessed too.

00:42:44.599 --> 00:42:46.000
You've been winning right from the start.

00:42:46.320 --> 00:42:47.880
Does that count as cheating?

00:43:08.239 --> 00:43:09.239
I'm Peng Yuchang,

00:43:09.239 --> 00:43:10.840
inviting you to watch the TV drama

00:43:10.840 --> 00:43:11.679
*Confrontation*.

00:43:12.199 --> 00:43:13.199
News of Operation Spring Thunder

00:43:13.199 --> 00:43:14.360
couldn't have spread this fast,

00:43:14.360 --> 00:43:15.760
reaching the press overnight.

00:43:15.760 --> 00:43:16.920
There must be a mole inside.

00:43:17.119 --> 00:43:18.840
What's the point of saying all that?

00:43:18.840 --> 00:43:20.159
If there's a mole, weed him out!

00:43:20.159 --> 00:43:21.079
Step out of the car.

00:43:21.079 --> 00:43:21.599
ID and driver's license.

00:43:21.599 --> 00:43:22.320
Stop taking photos.

00:43:22.679 --> 00:43:23.719
Keep flashing that and you'll blind me.

00:43:23.719 --> 00:43:24.440
What are you doing?

00:43:25.039 --> 00:43:25.679
Assaulting an officer, are you?

00:43:25.679 --> 00:43:26.559
Bro, it's you!

00:43:27.000 --> 00:43:28.239
Don't pull that routine with me.

00:43:28.239 --> 00:43:29.360
Strictly official business.

00:43:29.360 --> 00:43:30.519
Come on, we're on the same side anyway.

00:43:30.519 --> 00:43:32.280
Your unit can do the paperwork to retrieve the car.

00:43:32.280 --> 00:43:34.199
Brother, which unit is getting the car?

00:43:34.199 --> 00:43:35.639
Just in case my buddy misremembered.